SonarQube and the containers must use the same bucket and credentials. Set the values you passed to
`generate.py` (`AGENTIC_STORAGE_*` in `.env`):

```
sonar.agentic.storage.type=S3
sonar.agentic.storage.bucket=${s3_bucket}
sonar.agentic.storage.region=${s3_region}
sonar.agentic.storage.endpoint=${s3_endpoint}
${credential_lines_storage}sonar.agentic.storage.path-style-access=${s3_path_style}
sonar.agentic.storage.presign-ttl-seconds=${s3_presign_ttl}
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.type=S3
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.bucket=${s3_bucket}
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.region=${s3_region}
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.endpoint=${s3_endpoint}
${credential_lines_orchestrator}sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.path-style-access=${s3_path_style}
sonar.agentic.orchestrator.storage.presign-ttl-seconds=${s3_presign_ttl}
```

